How to use

Set this:

producer:
  enabled: true
  message-count: 20000

Start app, and it sends.

If you want to stop sending on startup:

producer:
  enabled: false
Example config changes
Same header for every message
producer:
  headers:
    source: fixed-source
Unique header per message
producer:
  headers:
    mid: mid-{{i}}
